{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/store_capsule_main_english.png?t=1744607032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you play as the protagonist and make your way through the story in visual novel format. Sit back, relax, and enjoy the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/story_eng.png?t=1744607032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's polished, caring, kind, and gets good grades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're just enjoying your life with her when one day, you get into an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you wake up in the hospital, you've forgotten all about your family, friends\u2026 and her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You try to restore your memories, but other women approach you, taking advantage of your amnesia with half-truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/kaede2.gif?t=1744607032\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/characters_eng.png?t=1744607032\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Iori_Kurose_eng.png?t=1744607032\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Nagisa_Kitatani_eng.png?t=1744607032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/Akari_Hoshino_eng.png?t=1744607032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/